# Setup TODO

## Checklist

- [ ] Create Cloudflare API token
- [ ] Add GitHub secrets (`CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN`, `CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID`, `OPS_API_TOKEN`){% if domain %}
- [ ] Configure custom domain in Cloudflare{% endif %}
